# Links lychee should not verify.
#
# The demo gifs are build artifacts: the tapes render them into dist/, which
# .gitignore excludes and `goreleaser release --clean` wipes. The README
# gallery links them as release assets instead, at a fixed
# releases/latest/download/<name>.gif URL per demo.
#
# Those URLs 404 until .github/workflows/demos.yml has attached the gifs to a
# release, which it does on release publish and on merge to the default
# branch. The link check has to skip them until then. Once the assets are on
# the latest release this line can go, and a broken gallery link becomes a
# real failure again.
https://github\.com/jarvisfriends/snap/releases/latest/download/.*\.gif$
